WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:28.560
O Holy night, the stars are brightly shining,
It is the night of our dear Savior's birth

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:53.440
Long lay the world in sin and error pining
Til He appeared and the soul felt its worth

00:00:53.440 --> 00:01:12.160
A thrill of hope the weary world rejoices
For yonder breaks a new and glorious morn

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:30.320
Fall on your knees
O hear the angel voices

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:38.880
O night divine!

00:01:38.880 --> 00:02:05.120
O night when Christ was born
O night divine!

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:18.000
O night, o night divine!

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:40.800
Led by the light of faith serenely beaming, 
With glowing hearts by His cradle we stand.

00:02:44.320 --> 00:03:05.669
Led by a star above them brightly gleaming, 
appeared the wise men from far Eastern land

00:03:05.680 --> 00:03:24.879
The King of kings lay in a lowly manger; 
to us this day is born to be our God:

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:33.360
Fall on your knees

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:41.939
O hear the angel voices

00:03:42.000 --> 00:04:00.000
O night divine
O night when Christ was born

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:13.360
O night divine, O night

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:28.240
O night divine!

